// L9: cycle Order(r11) any_order law(Order exact commutative) {merge}
// control upfront
// cost W=18298 O=18293 split when n > 32, n = len(r9)
// lower in place: its first stage spawns no heavy or io call before it waits
while r38 -> L6 else L3 stages [L5, L6, L10]
